{
 "about": "Front RU0: the ru glossary (plan analysis/front-plans/front-i18n-ru.md §5) that src/i18n/ru/ru.test.ts enforces through the SC4 lint framework (src/i18n/lint/, profile ru) on every Russian string. Seeded from the French glossary: the same English patterns and interface names, retargeted to Russian from the English (French and Spanish only as meaning context) and Russian astronomy textbook usage. A term applies when its English pattern matches the English source: the Russian must then match the `ru` pattern, written as stems and alternations so that every case form passes (Russian inflects). Names are fixed interface names (an exact name applies only to a whole string; the name match ignores case and is a plain substring, so a few names that inflect in running text are kept as the shortest stable stem). Forbidden are the forms this glossary rejects (кластер, магнитуда, константа Хаббла, радиальная скорость, индекс цвета, CCD-камера, «загрузить» for download, the Latin redshift); the language-wide rules live in the ru profile of src/i18n/lint/profiles.ts. VIREO's own names follow the brief's decided forms (Save → Сохранить, Record → Записать, Load → Загрузить, Open → Открыть, download → Скачать, Find → Найти, Search → Поиск, Show → Показать, Display → Отображение, Slew → Навести, Init/Go → Подготовить/Пуск, Scan → Пролистать, Clear → Очистить, Reset → Сбросить, Hot List → список объектов, lab → лабораторная работа). Translations are web adaptations by OpenVireo, never CLEA's.",
